<h1 class="page-title">AEO tools — honest comparison (2026)</h1>
<p class="page-lede">Every AEO tool we know of, what each is actually good at, and which to pick for your use case. We list monitoraeo alongside Otterly.ai, Profound, Athena, Goodie and the rest — including the ones we lose to. Buyers research multiple tools; pretending alternatives don't exist signals lack of confidence.</p>

<h2>The landscape at a glance</h2>
<p>The AEO/GEO tooling category is ~2 years old. Most products launched in 2024–2025 and are iterating fast. The major dimensions to compare on are: which AI engines they actually query, whether they include an action plan (vs raw measurement only), pricing model, and whether they offer monthly monitoring or one-off audits.</p>

