<h2>Tool-by-tool breakdown</h2>

<div class="tool-card featured">
  <h3>monitoraeo <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500;">(us)</span></h3>
  <p class="tagline">Full AEO audit + monitoring across all 5 AI engines, with a prioritised action plan.</p>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="pros">
      <h4>Strengths</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>All 5 engines queried (Google AI, ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini)</li>
        <li>Free 8-question preview in ~30 seconds, no account required</li>
        <li>Cheapest paid one-off audit at $29 (Two Engine)</li>
        <li>Prioritised action plan generated by Claude Sonnet 4.6 from real findings</li>
        <li>Public AEO rankings at /ai-visibility provide unique benchmarking data</li>
        <li>15-check technical GEO foundation audit included</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="cons">
      <h4>Weaknesses</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Newer category entrant — smaller customer base than Otterly/Profound</li>
        <li>No content workflow integrations (Notion, Webflow, WordPress)</li>
        <li>Single-language (English) audit query generation</li>
        <li>No team-collaboration features beyond brand sharing</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="best-for"><strong>Best for:</strong> Brands wanting maximum engine coverage at the lowest price, with an action plan that tells you what to actually do — not just what your numbers are.</div>
</div>

<div class="tool-card">
  <h3>Otterly.ai</h3>
  <p class="tagline">Established AEO monitoring tool, polished UX, narrower engine coverage.</p>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="pros">
      <h4>Strengths</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Mature product, well-designed dashboard</li>
        <li>Strong onboarding flow + sample reports</li>
        <li>Free starter tier for limited tracking</li>
        <li>Good documentation and learning resources</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="cons">
      <h4>Weaknesses</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Doesn't cover Claude or Gemini natively</li>
        <li>Subscription-only (no one-off audit option)</li>
        <li>Action plan is partial / templated rather than per-finding</li>
        <li>Higher price per engine covered</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="best-for"><strong>Best for:</strong> Teams already standardised on ChatGPT + Perplexity who want a polished UX and don't need Claude or Gemini coverage yet.</div>
</div>

<div class="tool-card">
  <h3>Profound</h3>
  <p class="tagline">Enterprise-tier AEO platform; rich coverage, rich price tag.</p>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="pros">
      <h4>Strengths</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Broadest engine coverage including custom LLM connectors</li>
        <li>Enterprise reporting, SSO, custom dashboards</li>
        <li>Used by several large brands as their internal AEO source-of-truth</li>
        <li>Strong analyst content + research reports</li>
